# Mountain King's native checks by parity: #125 Storm Bolt, Thunder Clap, Hammerfall.
# Mountain King a against Mountain King b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero mountain king
# Storm Bolt out and back; its return hits b.
60 a tap X 2
# Storm Bolt recalled early on its 16th frame.
200 a tap X 2
215 a tap X 2
# b dashes in; a late Thunder Clap, held 50 frames.
300 b stick -1 0
308 b stick 0 0
330 a stick 0 -1
330 a press X
331 a stick 0 0
380 a release X
# Thunder Leap, Hammerfall on its 16th frame.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick 0 1
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
615 a tap X 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 13 form 0
#! expect b 104 damage 5.000
#! expect a 200 special 13 form 0
#! expect b 245 damage 10.000
#! expect a 330 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 394 damage 17.000 hitlag 5 hitstun 20
#! expect a 600 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 615 special-form 5 action 15
#! expect a 625 special 0 form 5
#! scene a StormBoltMissile
#! scene a ThunderClapCaster
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
